      <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-normal text-gray-900 mb-3">AI Chatbots vs Traditional Customer Service</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">The adoption of AI chatbots presents a significant shift in customer service strategies for SMEs. Here's a comparative look at AI chatbots versus traditional customer service methods:

### AI Chatbots vs Traditional Customer Service
| Factor               | AI Chatbots                 | Traditional Customer Service  |
|----------------------|------------------------------|-------------------------------|
| <strong>Cost Efficiency</strong>   | Lower long-term costs by automating responses | Higher costs due to labor expenses |
| <strong>Availability</strong>      | 24/7 operation, no downtime   | Limited by working hours         |
| <strong>Response Time</strong>     | Instant responses to inquiries | Slower, dependent on wait times  |
| <strong>Personalization</strong>    | Can use data to tailor responses | Personal touch, but less scalable |
| <strong>Scalability</strong>       | Easily scales to handle high volumes | Requires more staff for busy periods |

While traditional customer service provides the personal touch that cannot be replicated, AI chatbots offer significant advantages in cost and efficiency, making them a recommended starting point for SMEs wishing to implement AI without extensive resources.</p>
